# Files that live in this folder but must not be served from the site.
# Nothing here is secret — there are no keys or credentials anywhere in this
# project — but none of it belongs on the public domain either.

# 46KB of internal engineering notes. Would be readable at /README.md
README.md

# the local preview server; also hard-codes a path off this machine
dev-server.py

# self-contained copies of the whole site, for sending to people directly.
# Serving them would mean a second, silently stale copy of the site living at
# a guessable URL.
Heloria Labs*.html

# superseded share image
assets/og-previous.png

# local dev-server launch config
.claude
